        "body": "The Department of the Interior is the largest buying agency with $314M in obligations. The Department of Defense follows with $84.4M, and the Department of Veterans Affairs follows with $42M. The Department of Transportation and the Department of Agriculture add $39.8M and $31.5M respectively."
      },
      {
        "heading": "Which industries and vendors capture the largest shares?",
        "body": "Water and Sewer Line and Related Structures Construction is the largest industry with $246M in obligations. Highway, Street, and Bridge Construction and Commercial and Institutional Building Construction recorded $62.9M and $58M respectively. RECORD STEEL AND CONSTRUCTION, INC. and G.S.E. CONSTRUCTION COMPANY, INC. are the top vendors with $129M and $109M respectively."
      }
